    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1901810/extras/38b480e848eccccf45d1668510b56309.poster.avif?t=1724142583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1901810/extras/38b480e848eccccf45d1668510b56309.webm?t=1724142583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1901810/extras/38b480e848eccccf45d1668510b56309.mp4?t=1724142583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1901810/extras/a1b7440c41013d98f0c265ee859ab3ac.poster.avif?t=1724142583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1901810/extras/a1b7440c41013d98f0c265ee859ab3ac.webm?t=1724142583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1901810/extras/a1b7440c41013d98f0c265ee859ab3ac.mp4?t=1724142583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&quot;When you're surrounded by zombies...</h2><br>For the best experience, online co-op play with friends is recommended.<br><br>In Nearly Dead: Live and Let Die, survivors venture out to explore other regions and gather valuable items by day, and fend off hordes of enemies seeking to invade their hideout by night.<br><br>This is a top-down hack-and-slash game in which players face off against the enemy hordes, combining a variety of active skills with dozens of traits and some 300 types of randomly acquired items. Protect yourselves against menacing enemies by exploring and growing with teammates, freely wielding never-before-seen weapons with a variety of patterns.<br><br>If you've survived long enough and become strong enough, you can visit new regions to fight boss battles or put an end to these fights.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><br>You\u2019ll need to explore by day to procure items from regions overrun by zombies. Different options are available each day, and players can vote to decide which region to explore. <br><br>At night, you\u2019ll need to defend your hideout against rampaging enemy swarms.<br><br>You can get resources directly from enemies, but you may also need to disassemble unneeded items. Craft new weapons using these resources, or supply consumed weapons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main features:</h2><br>Co-op: Play offline or together with up to 4 players.<br>Growth: You can strengthen your character by acquiring weapons, traits, and accessories and utilizing the synergy between them. <br>Customization: Customize your character with hundreds of possible outfits. You can also change the color of clothing.&quot;",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1901810/extras/38b480e848eccccf45d1668510b56309.poster.avif?t=1724142583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1901810/extras/38b480e848eccccf45d1668510b56309.webm?t=1724142583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1901810/extras/38b480e848eccccf45d1668510b56309.mp4?t=1724142583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1901810/extras/a1b7440c41013d98f0c265ee859ab3ac.poster.avif?t=1724142583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1901810/extras/a1b7440c41013d98f0c265ee859ab3ac.webm?t=1724142583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1901810/extras/a1b7440c41013d98f0c265ee859ab3ac.mp4?t=1724142583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&quot;When you're surrounded by zombies...</h2><br>For the best experience, online co-op play with friends is recommended.<br><br>In Nearly Dead: Live and Let Die, survivors venture out to explore other regions and gather valuable items by day, and fend off hordes of enemies seeking to invade their hideout by night.<br><br>This is a top-down hack-and-slash game in which players face off against the enemy hordes, combining a variety of active skills with dozens of traits and some 300 types of randomly acquired items. Protect yourselves against menacing enemies by exploring and growing with teammates, freely wielding never-before-seen weapons with a variety of patterns.<br><br>If you've survived long enough and become strong enough, you can visit new regions to fight boss battles or put an end to these fights.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><br>You\u2019ll need to explore by day to procure items from regions overrun by zombies. Different options are available each day, and players can vote to decide which region to explore. <br><br>At night, you\u2019ll need to defend your hideout against rampaging enemy swarms.<br><br>You can get resources directly from enemies, but you may also need to disassemble unneeded items. Craft new weapons using these resources, or supply consumed weapons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main features:</h2><br>Co-op: Play offline or together with up to 4 players.<br>Growth: You can strengthen your character by acquiring weapons, traits, and accessories and utilizing the synergy between them. <br>Customization: Customize your character with hundreds of possible outfits. You can also change the color of clothing.&quot;",
    "short_description": "2D top-down multi co-op action game. Survive the zombies together with a stranger.",
